  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You direct some of the excess fate liberated in the creation of seals to ensure that your seals go through and hit their intended target like a ton of unlucky bricks.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Seal Focus</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws made against your seals. This stacks with the bonus granted by Seal Focus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
